{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"LEA Tool Gateway","version":"0.1.0"},"paths":{"/session/capabilities":{"post":{"tags":["session"],"summary":"Get Capabilities","description":"这个 session 能用的工具清单。\n\n`req.user_id` 以前**收到了但丢掉了** —— 请求体里一直有这个字段，下面两处却都不\n传。工具按租户可见时那没有可观察的后果，改成按人可见之后它就是\"把 alice 的清单\n发给 bob\"。","operationId":"get_capabilities_session_capabilities_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CapabilityRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CapabilityResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/tools/execute":{"post":{"tags":["tools"],"summary":"Execute Tool","description":"执行一个工具。\n\n⚠️ `X-User-ID` 是**可选**的，不是必填 —— 缺了不返 422，而是退化成\"只能用平台\n工具\"（见 visible_tools 的 fail-closed 说明）。必填的话任何还没跟上的调用方\n会从\"少几个工具\"变成\"整条工具链 422\"，那是个比漏工具严重得多的失败。","operationId":"execute_tool_tools_execute_post","parameters":[{"name":"X-Tenant-ID","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"X-Tenant-Id"}},{"name":"X-User-ID","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"X-User-Id"}},{"name":"X-User-Role","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"user","title":"X-User-Role"}},{"name":"X-Agent-ID","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"X-Agent-Id"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ExecuteRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ExecuteResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/mcp-servers/{server_id}/test":{"post":{"tags":["admin-mcp"],"summary":"Test Mcp Connection","description":"连一下看看通不通，**不写 tools 表**。\n\n跟 /sync 分开是因为它们回答的是两个问题：「这个地址配对了吗」和「把工具同步进来」。\n把前者绑在后者上，用户填错一个 URL 得先触发一次会写库的操作才知道。","operationId":"test_mcp_connection_admin_mcp_servers__server_id__test_post","parameters":[{"name":"server_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Server Id"}},{"name":"X-Tenant-ID","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"X-Tenant-Id"}},{"name":"X-User-Role","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"user","title":"X-User-Role"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/admin/mcp-servers/{server_id}/sync":{"post":{"tags":["admin-mcp"],"summary":"Sync Mcp Tools","description":"把远端 MCP server 暴露的工具同步进 tools 表。\n\n── 身份从哪来 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n跟 execute.py 一样走 X-Tenant-ID / X-User-Role 头，由 lea-agent 的反代重写\n（proxy.go 三个头都 Set-或-Del，X-User-Role 按白名单下发）。这里**不**用\nlea_authkit.require_actor：那个依赖要求 X-User-ID，而本服务的调用方是引擎而\n不是浏览器，引擎不一定带用户 id。租户 + 角色够这个端点用。\n\n⚠️ 因此这道门的强度来自\"只有 lea-agent 能打到这个端口\"（internal_auth +\nNetworkPolicy）。install_internal_auth 已经在 server.py 上挂了中间件。\n\n── 幂等 + 并发安全 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n两个副本、或两个管理员，可能同时 sync 同一个 server。所以：\n\n  · 按 (tenant_id, name) 查了再决定 update 还是 insert，不盲插\n  · 「远端已经没有的工具」要删，但**不能先删后插** —— 那个中间窗口里别的请求\n    会读到一份空的工具清单，表现是\"工具偶尔全没了\"。这里用集合差集，在同一个\n    事务里只删该删的。","operationId":"sync_mcp_tools_admin_mcp_servers__server_id__sync_post","parameters":[{"name":"server_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","title":"Server Id"}},{"name":"X-Tenant-ID","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"X-Tenant-Id"}},{"name":"X-User-Role","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"user","title":"X-User-Role"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/internal/mcp/discover":{"post":{"tags":["internal-mcp"],"summary":"Discover","description":"连一下远端，把 tools/list 的结果原样返回。\n\n## 连不通返回 200 + ok:false，不是 502\n\n跟 `/admin/mcp-servers/{id}/test` 同一个取向：**请求本身成功了** —— 我们成功地测出\n了\"连不通\"。502 会让调用方分不清「发现这个动作失败了」和「发现结果是连不通」，而\n那两种情况调用方要做的事完全不同（重试 vs 把错误写到那一行上给用户看）。\n\n## 不做任何过滤和改名\n\n`tool_filter` 是策略（只暴露哪几个），前缀是命名规则 —— 两者都归调用方。这里返回\n远端说的原样，好让调用方那边只有一处决定\"哪些留下、叫什么名字\"。","operationId":"discover_internal_mcp_discover_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DiscoverRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DiscoverResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/sandbox/sessions":{"post":{"tags":["sandbox"],"summary":"Create Session","operationId":"create_session_sandbox_sessions_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CreateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CreateResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/sandbox/sessions/{session_id}/exec":{"post":{"tags":["sandbox"],"summary":"Exec Code","operationId":"exec_code_sandbox_sessions__session_id__exec_post","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Session Id"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ExecRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/sandbox/sessions/{session_id}/upload":{"post":{"tags":["sandbox"],"summary":"Upload File","operationId":"upload_file_sandbox_sessions__session_id__upload_post","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Session Id"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UploadRequest"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/sandbox/sessions/{session_id}/download":{"get":{"tags":["sandbox"],"summary":"Download File","operationId":"download_file_sandbox_sessions__session_id__download_get","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Session Id"}},{"name":"path","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Path"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/sandbox/sessions/{session_id}":{"get":{"tags":["sandbox"],"summary":"Get Session State","description":"问 Cube 这个会话的沙箱现在是什么状态。不碰它，纯只读。\n\n## 为什么需要这个端点\n\n沙箱的生命周期是**三段**的，而中间那段没有任何代码路径：\n\n  0 ~ CUBE_SANDBOX_TIMEOUT      running\n  timeout ~ IDLE_TIMEOUT        paused（Cube 按 on_timeout=pause 自己转的）\n  IDLE_TIMEOUT 之后             回收器真删\n\n转 paused 和 auto_resume 都是 Cube 侧的策略，我们一行代码都不写。好处是它不会\n因为我们的进程重启而失效；代价是**它对我们完全不可见** —— 没有这个端点的话，\n\"暂停恢复到底有没有在工作\"只能靠等下一次调用会不会超时来猜，而那猜不出区别：\nauto_resume 成功和从没暂停过，从调用方看是一样的。\n\n直接读 Cube 的 state，不缓存、不掺本进程的句柄表 —— 本进程有没有句柄跟沙箱\n活没活着是两件事（多副本下经常不一致），而这里要答的是后者。","operationId":"get_session_state_sandbox_sessions__session_id__get","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Session Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["sandbox"],"summary":"Destroy Session","description":"删掉会话的沙箱。\n\n## 三种结果，必须分开报\n\n  200 found=true    删掉了\n  200 found=false   本来就没有（回收器先删了 / 从没建过）—— DELETE 是幂等的，\n                    用户要的\"让它不存在\"已经成立\n  503               Cube 问不到，或者删的时候它拒绝了（paused 沙箱 restore\n                    失败返 409、状态转换中返 503）。**不知道有没有删掉**，\n                    必须让调用方重试\n\n只有这里的 KeyError 翻成 200 而不是 404 —— 跟 exec/upload/download 不一样。\n那几个是\"要用它\"，不存在就是真的做不了事；这个是\"要它没了\"，不存在恰好就是\n目标状态。前端为一次成功的删除弹一个红色 404 是纯粹的噪音。\n\n找不到和删掉了仍然分开报（found 字段），因为调用方偶尔需要知道 —— 验收脚本要\n断言\"删之前它确实在\"，这个字段是唯一的判据。","operationId":"destroy_session_sandbox_sessions__session_id__delete","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Session Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/list":{"get":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"List Files","description":"列 workspace 文件树。store 由 FILE_STORE 决定（nfs / sandbox / auto）。","operationId":"list_files_api_files_list_get","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Session Id"}},{"name":"tenant_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"租户 ID；空则只能走 sandbox store","default":"","title":"Tenant Id"},"description":"租户 ID；空则只能走 sandbox store"},{"name":"show_hidden","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","default":false,"title":"Show Hidden"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/read":{"get":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Read File","description":"读一个文件，连同 (size, mtime_ns) 一起返回。\n\n调用方必须记住这两个值：写回同一文件时要带上，服务端用它判断\"你读完之后有没有\n别人改过\"。这是防丢失更新的关键 —— 见 file_store 模块文档。","operationId":"read_file_api_files_read_get","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Session Id"}},{"name":"tenant_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Tenant Id"}},{"name":"path","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"workspace 内相对路径","title":"Path"},"description":"workspace 内相对路径"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/write":{"post":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Write File","description":"整文件写入（原子替换）。覆盖已存在的文件需通过新鲜度校验。","operationId":"write_file_api_files_write_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WriteRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/skills/provision":{"post":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Provision Skills","description":"把 agent 绑定的 skill 投递到 session 的 skills 目录。\n\n调用方是 lea-agent 的会话创建路径。在此之前投递只发生在**沙箱创建那一刻**\n（sandbox_session.py 的 create()），于是 skill 文件在盘上的时机取决于模型有没有\n恰好先调过一次 code_interpreter —— Read/Glob 这类不进沙箱的工具因此读不到\nskills/，报 FileNotFoundError。把投递绑到会话生命周期上就没有这个隐式依赖。\n\n幂等：ensure_cached 按 bundle 的 sha 复用 `{root}/cache/skills/<sha>/`，\n所以重复调用是本地目录拷贝，不重新下 S3。沙箱创建时那次投递保留不动 ——\n兜住没走这条新路径的调用方，多投一次无害。\n\n整体失败不抛 5xx：读不到 skill 文件是降级（模型少一份参考），让会话建不起来\n是彻底不可用。失败的 skill 名字在 provisioned 里缺席，调用方可据此告警。","operationId":"provision_skills_api_files_skills_provision_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SkillProvisionRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/edit":{"post":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Edit File","description":"串替换。要求 old_string 在文件里**恰好出现一次**。\n\n0 次和多次都报错而不是猜：静默改第一处是最难发现的一类错误 —— 调用方以为改对了，\n实际改的是另一处，而且没有任何信号。报错信息告诉模型怎么让匹配唯一。","operationId":"edit_file_api_files_edit_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/EditRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/uploads/blob":{"post":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Put Upload Blob","description":"把用户上传的原件字节写进 OBS，返回 key + sha256。\n\nsha 允许调用方传进来（它为了算配额和缓存键本来就要算一次），留空则这里算。\n传了的话会**校验**——对不上说明传输中出了问题，宁可报错也不能让 key 和内容不符：\nkey 是内容寻址的，不符就意味着以后按 sha 命中缓存会拿到别的文件的解析结果。","operationId":"put_upload_blob_api_files_uploads_blob_post","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Body_put_upload_blob_api_files_uploads_blob_post"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"get":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Get Upload Blob","description":"取原件字节。用户下载自己上传的文件走这条路。\n\n走 OBS 而不是会话目录：blob 是真源，会话归档后 NFS 那份已经清理掉了，blob 还在。\n\n**这里不做归属校验** —— 跟本模块其余端点一致，鉴权在 lea-agent 反代层\n（它按 attachment_id 查库确认 tenant/user，再拿 file_key 打这里）。file_key 本身\n不可猜（含 sha256），但那不是安全边界，别依赖它。","operationId":"get_upload_blob_api_files_uploads_blob_get","parameters":[{"name":"file_key","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"OBS key","title":"File Key"},"description":"OBS key"},{"name":"filename","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"下载时给浏览器的文件名","default":"","title":"Filename"},"description":"下载时给浏览器的文件名"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/uploads/stage":{"post":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Stage Upload","description":"把 OBS 上的原件物化到会话 uploads/ 目录，让沙箱能打开它。\n\n配额在这里生效（传给 stage，由它在下载**之前**判）—— 不在上传端点判，因为会话目录\n的占用还有模型自己写的部分，闸门必须在所有写入路径的汇合处。\n超限返 507，调用方据此退化成\"只抽文本不落地\"。","operationId":"stage_upload_api_files_uploads_stage_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/StageRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/blob":{"delete":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Delete Blob","description":"删掉一个 OBS 对象。用户在文件库里删文件时，由 lea-agent 在**删完登记行、\n并确认同租户内再没有别的行引用同一个 sha 之后**调这里。\n\n## 引用计数为什么不在这边做\n\n这个服务不连业务库（见模块头：它不做 JWT，也不查 chat_attachments /\nsession_artifacts）。要在这里数引用就得给它一条数据库连接，而那会让\"谁是数据的\n权威\"变成两个答案。lea-agent 手里已经有库和事务顺序，判定留在它那边。\n\n这边只保证一件事：**这个 key 长得像我们自己的东西**。没有这道校验的话，\n一个 DELETE 端点加上任意 key 就是\"删掉 bucket 里任何对象\"——包括别的租户的\n上传件和沙箱的 volume 对象。\n\n幂等：S3 对不存在的 key 也返 204，所以重复删是安全的（引用计数判完到真删之间\n进程挂掉，重试不会出错）。","operationId":"delete_blob_api_files_blob_delete","parameters":[{"name":"file_key","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"OBS key","title":"File Key"},"description":"OBS key"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/artifacts/publish":{"post":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Publish Artifact","description":"把会话工作区里的一个文件发布到 OBS 的 library/ 前缀。\n\n幂等：内容寻址，同一份内容重复发布是同一个 key，OBS 那边 head 一下就跳过。\n所以模型改三轮才定稿、每轮都 deliver 的成本是三次 head + 一次 put。\n\n## 不判配额\n\n配额判定在 lea-agent 那一侧（它才知道这个 user 的库里已经占了多少 —— 那个数字\n要查 MySQL）。而且交付超限是**软放行**：行落下来、obs_key 留空、给模型一句降级\n说明。所以这个端点被调到就是要写，写不进去才报错。\n\n## 大小上限借用产物下载那个（500MB）\n\n模型能交付的东西不该比用户能下载的东西大 —— 那样交付成功了但没人取得到。","operationId":"publish_artifact_api_files_artifacts_publish_post","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PublishRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/files/download":{"get":{"tags":["files"],"summary":"Download","operationId":"download_api_files_download_get","parameters":[{"name":"session_id","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"沙箱 session_id","title":"Session Id"},"description":"沙箱 session_id"},{"name":"path","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"相对 /workspace 的产物路径，如 report.xlsx","title":"Path"},"description":"相对 /workspace 的产物路径，如 report.xlsx"},{"name":"tenant_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"租户 ID（有值则走 NFS 直读）","default":"","title":"Tenant Id"},"description":"租户 ID（有值则走 NFS 直读）"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/health":{"get":{"summary":"Health","operationId":"health_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}}},"components":{"schemas":{"Body_put_upload_blob_api_files_uploads_blob_post":{"properties":{"file":{"type":"string","contentMediaType":"application/octet-stream","title":"File"},"tenant_id":{"type":"string","title":"Tenant Id"},"sha256":{"type":"string","title":"Sha256","description":"调用方算好的 sha256；留空则这里算","default":""}},"type":"object","required":["file","tenant_id"],"title":"Body_put_upload_blob_api_files_uploads_blob_post"},"CapabilityRequest":{"properties":{"tenant_id":{"type":"string","title":"Tenant Id"},"user_id":{"type":"string","title":"User Id"},"role":{"type":"string","title":"Role","default":"user"},"agent_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Agent Id"}},"type":"object","required":["tenant_id","user_id"],"title":"CapabilityRequest"},"CapabilityResponse":{"properties":{"tools":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"type":"array","title":"Tools"},"ttl":{"type":"integer","title":"Ttl","default":300},"cached":{"type":"boolean","title":"Cached","default":false}},"type":"object","required":["tools"],"title":"CapabilityResponse"},"CreateRequest":{"properties":{"session_id":{"type":"string","title":"Session Id"},"skill_id":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Skill Id"},"user_id":{"type":"string","title":"User Id","default":""},"tenant_id":{"type":"string","title":"Tenant Id","default":